resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 format jsonl (3/6) | jsonl-40x12
expect: findings.jsonl
keys: PageDown
require-live-snap: 15 format jsonl (3/6) | jsonl-paged-40x12
expect: findings.jsonl
keys: PageUp j
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_report.py @TARGET @ART read
ask: Can the operator see each selected format and its destination throughout paging and resize, without the large study hiding these controls?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 work finished | recovered-work
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 format json (4/6) | recovered-report
expect: findings.json
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_report.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the saved JSON choice and destination, with identical 24-job history, nine decisions and no new scan or model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
